# Mold Adder, a blue and black spell triggers it once, not twice (CR 603.2c, 105.2): Bot2's Baleful Strix is both colors, and Bot1 is offered a single counter; there is
# no second offer, so the counter count is 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mold Adder
Mox Emerald
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Baleful Strix
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mold Adder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Baleful Strix.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mold Adder.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Baleful Strix; Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire
